# Live credential dumps (DNSE/TCBS keys, tokens, captured API payloads)
# NEVER commit: docs/references/ contains real secrets (audited 2026-09-22)
docs/references/*
# EXCEPTION: vendor OpenAPI spec cua TCBS (public, da quet 0 secret: 0 jwt / 0 bearer /
# 0 apiKey value / 0 long-hex). Commit de moi agent trong worktree co tai lieu doi chieu
# — khong co spec nay thi P1-P4 va AC M6/E1/E2 khong kiem chung duoc.
# chi loai tru DUNG file nay; cac file con lai trong docs/references/ van bi ignore.
!docs/references/openapi-v1.0.0.json
